@page "/roof-replacement-charlotte-nc"
@{
    ViewData["Lang"] = "en";
    ViewData["SeoEn"] = "/roof-replacement-charlotte-nc";
    ViewData["SeoEs"] = "/es/reemplazo-techo-charlotte-nc";
    ViewData["SeoAlert"] = "Need a new roof after a storm?";
}
<main class="resource-site" lang="en">
    @await Html.PartialAsync("_SeoIntentHeader")
    <section class="resource-hero systems-hero">
        <div class="site-shell">
            <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Roof replacement Charlotte NC</p>
            <h1>Roof Replacement in Charlotte, NC</h1>
            <p>Architectural shingles, premium systems and metal roof planning for a complete new roof. Written scope, tear-off, ventilation and flashing are confirmed on site. Use the planner on the homepage for a range, then inspect before you hire.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a class="button button-gold" href="#contact">Request a replacement inspection</a>
                <a class="button button-ghost" href="/roof-replacement-cost-charlotte-nc">Roof replacement cost</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="resource-body section" id="process">
        <div class="site-shell resource-sections">
            <article><span>01</span><div>
                <h2>What a full roof replacement includes</h2>
                <p>A replacement is a system: tear-off, decking repairs if needed, underlayment, starter, field shingles, hips, ridges, flashing, ventilation and cleanup. Color and manufacturer are confirmed in writing before installation. See <a class="official-link" href="/roofing-systems-charlotte-nc">roofing systems</a> to compare shingles, Class 4 and metal.</p>
            </div></article>
            <article><span>02</span><div>
                <h2>How we install, not just how it looks</h2>
                <p>Majestic measures geometry, pitch, access and penetrations. The installation sequence is explained before work starts. Qualifying replacements include a 10-year workmanship warranty. Manufacturer terms depend on the documented product. Financing is discussed only when a real option exists for that project—never as a homepage gimmick.</p>
            </div></article>
            <article><span>03</span><div>
                <h2>Storms, claims and a new roof</h2>
                <p>If hail or wind prompted the project, documentation stays factual. The carrier decides coverage. Majestic builds the roof to the agreed construction scope. Pair this page with <a class="official-link" href="/repair-or-replace-roof">repair vs replace</a>, <a class="official-link" href="/roof-insurance-claim-charlotte-nc">claim documentation</a> and <a class="official-link" href="/roof-installation-charlotte-nc">installation</a>.</p>
            </div></article>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="faq-section section" id="faq">
        <div class="site-shell faq-layout">
            <div><p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p><h2>Roof replacement questions</h2></div>
            <div class="faq-list">
                <details><summary>How much does a new roof cost in Charlotte?<span>+</span></summary><p>Cost depends on squares, pitch, complexity, material, tear-off and decking. Open <a href="/roof-replacement-cost-charlotte-nc">roof replacement cost in Charlotte</a> and the homepage planner, then confirm with an inspection.</p></details>
                <details><summary>How do I know if I need a new roof?<span>+</span></summary><p>Age, repeated leaks, widespread wind or hail patterns, sagging and failed repairs are common signals. An inspection separates patchable damage from a roof that will not hold another repair.</p></details>
                <details><summary>Can I replace only part of my roof?<span>+</span></summary><p>Sometimes a slope can be isolated. Matching color and remaining life still matter. We explain when a partial replacement is honest and when it creates a future leak line.</p></details>
                <details><summary>Do you install metal roofs?<span>+</span></summary><p>Metal is planned as a complete system, not a color sample. Compare options on the systems page and request a metal-specific inspection.</p></details>
                <details><summary>Is Raleigh in the replacement service area?<span>+</span></summary><p>No. Availability is confirmed by address within about 90 minutes of Charlotte, NC or Rock Hill, SC.</p></details>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    @await Html.PartialAsync("_SeoIntentFooter")
</main>
